{"id":"inspiration","lemma":"inspiration","pos":"noun","rank":3191,"glosses":["inspiration (instance of breathing in)","inspiration (divine intervention)","inspiration (something which brings about creativity or perseverance)"],"ipa":"/ɛ̃s.pi.ʁa.sjɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c7/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-inspiration.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-inspiration.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"inspirations"},"formAudio":{"inspirations":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/69/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-inspirations.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"J'ai perdu mon inspiration.","en":"I lost my inspiration.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"lost"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Où puisez-vous votre inspiration ?","en":"Where do you get your inspiration from?","words":[{"g":"where"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"your, belonging to you"},null]},{"text":"Prends une grande inspiration et calme-toi.","en":"Take a deep breath and calm down.","words":[{"g":"to take","l":"prendre"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"big","l":"grand"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"calm"},{"g":"you"}]},{"text":"Il me faut de l'inspiration.","en":"I need inspiration.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to need","l":"falloir"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Prenez juste une profonde inspiration.","en":"Just take a deep breath.","words":[{"g":"to take","l":"prendre"},{"g":"fair, just"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"deep","l":"profond"},null]}]}